# Watcher state. The Lifos ledger records which legal positions a firm tracks
# and which knowledge-base files depend on them; the rättspraxis database holds
# the watchlist — which decisions the firm has asked to be told about, tied to
# its own matter references. Both are a map of the firm's matters. They belong
# on the firm's disk and nowhere else.
.lifos/
*-state.json
.rattspraxis/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
